The Green Father is an Outer God of decay and rebirth.

:::fields
Category :: Outer God
Edicts :: Abide by the cycles of life, aid childbirth
Divine Raiment :: Deep red, fiery
Domains :: [air](https://2e.aonprd.com/Domains.aspx?ID=1), decay, and the [[Firmament|firmament]]
